  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "こころやさしい　せいしつ。　だが\nいちど　いかりに　かられると　はげしい\nいぶきで　あたりを　はかい　しつくす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "마음이 따뜻하고 착하다. 하지만\n한번 화에 사로잡히면 거친\n숨결로 주변을 파괴해 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "心地非常善良。一旦被激怒，\n就會用非常猛烈的氣息\n把周圍破壞殆盡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "C’est une bonne pâte de nature, mais si par\nmalheur il s’énerve, il peut détruire tout ce qui\nl’entoure de son souffle puissant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat ein freundliches Wesen, aber wenn es zur\nWeißglut gebracht wird, zerstört es mit einem\nheftigen Hauch die gesamte Umgebung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es de naturaleza mansa, pero si se le provoca\ny monta en cólera, destruye todo lo que le rodea\ncon su aliento devastador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un’indole gentile, ma se si arrabbia\ndistrugge tutto quello che ha intorno\ncon un soffio devastante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has a compassionate personality, but if it is\nangered, it completely destroys its surroundings\nwith its intense breath.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "心優しい　性質。　だが\n一度　怒りに　かられると　激しい\n息吹で　あたりを　破壊　し尽くす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "心地非常善良。可一旦被激怒，\n就会用非常猛烈的气息\n把周围破坏殆尽。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es de naturaleza mansa, pero si se le provoca\ny monta en cólera, destruye todo lo que le rodea\ncon su aliento devastador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとなつっこく　こどもが　だいすき。\nなかよしの　こどもと　あそぶために\nやまおくから　まちに　おりてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람을 잘 따르고 아이를 좋아한다.\n사이 좋은 아이와 놀기 위해\n깊은 산 속에서 마을로 내려온다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "容易和人親近，最喜歡小孩子。\n為了和關係好的小孩子玩耍，\n會從深山裡來到城鎮。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il adore les enfants rieurs. Il n’hésite pas à\ndescendre de sa montagne pour venir en ville\njouer avec ses petits amis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist sehr freundlich und liebt Kinder. Häufig\nkommt es aus den Bergen herab in die Städte,\num mit seinen kleinen Freunden zu spielen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encantan los niños amistosos, hasta el punto\nde abandonar las montañas para acercarse a\nlos pueblos y así poder jugar con ellos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto socievole e adora i bambini, tanto da\nscendere dalle montagne e recarsi in città\nper giocare con i suoi piccoli amici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is friendly to people and loves\nchildren most of all. It comes from deep in the\nmountains to play with children it likes in town.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人懐っこく　子どもが　大好き。\n仲良しの　子どもと　遊ぶために\n山奥から　町に　降りてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "容易和人亲近，最喜欢小孩子。\n为了和关系好的小孩子玩耍，\n会从深山里降落到城镇。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le encantan los niños amistosos, hasta el punto\nde abandonar las montañas para acercarse a\nlos pueblos y así poder jugar con ellos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おともだちに　なった　こどもが\nいじめられると　いじめた　こどもの\nいえを　さがして　やきつくしてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "친구가 된 아이가 괴롭힘을\n당하면 괴롭힌 아이의\n집에 찾아가서 태워버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果和自己成為朋友的孩子被欺負，\n牠會去找出欺負人的那個孩子家，\n然後把房子燒光光。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’il apprend qu’un enfant avec lequel il s’est lié\nd’amitié est persécuté par ses camarades,\nil trouve leur maison et la réduit en cendres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn eines der Kinder, mit denen es befreundet\nist, von jemandem gehänselt wird, sucht es das\nHaus des Übeltäters auf und brennt es nieder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si un niño con el que ha trabado amistad sufre\nlas burlas de otro niño, busca la casa del\nabusón y le prende fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se i bambini con cui ha fatto amicizia vengono\nmaltrattati, cerca la casa dei responsabili e\nla riduce in cenere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If a child it has made friends with is bullied,\nDrampa will find the bully’s house and burn it to\nthe ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "お友達に　なった　子どもが\nいじめられると　いじめた　子どもの\n家を　探して　焼き尽くしてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果和自己成为朋友的孩子被欺负，\n就会找到欺负他的那个孩子家，\n然后用火燃烧殆尽。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si un niño con el que ha trabado amistad sufre\nlas burlas de otro niño, busca la casa del\nabusón y le prende fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まちに　あらわれ　こどもと　あそぶ。\nきけんな　めに　あっても　こどもを\nまもるので　おくさんも　あんしんだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "마을에 나타나서 아이들과 논다.\n위험에 처해도 아이를\n지켜주기 때문에 어머니도 안심할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會出現在城鎮裡和孩子們玩耍。\n遇上危險時會保護孩子，\n所以媽媽們也很放心。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vient en ville pour jouer avec les enfants,\net les protège en cas de danger. Les parents\npeuvent donc avoir l’esprit tranquille !",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es besucht so manche Stadt und spielt mit den\nKindern. Mütter können beruhigt sein, da es die\nKinder auch in brenzligen Situationen beschützt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se adentra en los pueblos para jugar con los\nniños. Los protege de cualquier peligro, así que\nsus padres están tranquilos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Visita le città per giocare con i bambini ed è\nsempre pronto a proteggerli. Per questo,\nquando c’è lui i genitori sono tranquilli.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
